{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">《美食強人》將於10月19日起，逢星期一至五晚上9時30分於翡翠台播映。節目由陳豪、龔嘉欣擔任主持，二人以身份進軍大灣區美食界，發掘大灣區「強中之強」的代表美食。 </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"350fbac8-5c22-4027-9feb-5d15833b.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mKBOAXG7ew1791538510.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"350fbac8-5c22-4027-9feb-5d15833b.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">「美食強人」作為無綫邁向 60 年重點節目之一，旨在打造首個由電視台起動的大灣區 GBA 美食指南，搜羅香港以至整個大灣區有實力的食肆，選出十大香港與及大灣區其他地區的經典美食，並將會舉辦首個大灣區人人都可參與的美食票選大行動。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"a5d90fc5-8eac-4fa5-94a5-c83b7a9b.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ne9qxX02Ad1791538520.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"a5d90fc5-8eac-4fa5-94a5-c83b7a9b.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">節目號召超過 50 位極具份量的專業名廚、名嘴食家及嘉賓藝人參與評分，化身神秘美食家親身試食，選出強中之強，觀眾亦可以舌尖投選，成就「大灣區最強十大美食」認證。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"> </p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left\">為隆重其事，TVB 昨（9 日）特假 TVB 舉行記者會，公布節目詳情。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T01:59:12.173349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}